            "text": "theorem pressure_radius_integral (C h τ z : ℝ) {r : ℝ} (hr : 0 < r) :\n    BaseExterior.heatPressure C h (TerminalStress.radiusPoint (1 - τ) r z) =\n      -(∫ ρ in Ioi r, amplitude C h τ ρ ^ 2 / ρ)"
